Subject: [PATCH] feat(otp): generate display reference for internal SMS OTP

Centralize a 4-char alphanumeric reference (no ambiguous chars) in the
internal OTP provider, inject {{reference}} into the SMS body template,
and return it on OtpSendResponse so client apps can show which SMS to use
after resends. Twilio Verify keeps reference=null; starter DTO updated.
